---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ContactButton from '../components/ContactButton.astro';
---

<Layout title="Education & Mentorship | Chef Gurbaj">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-20">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-heading mb-8 border-b border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-grey/20 pb-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-obsidian-black via-[#997a15] to-obsidian-black dark:from-[#d4af37] dark:via-[#fcf5d2] dark:to-[#d4af37] bg-[length:200%_auto] bg-clip-text text-transparent animate-gradient-wave">
      Culinary <span>Education</span>
    </h1>

    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert prose-p:text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey prose-headings:text-obsidian-black dark:text-pristine-white max-w-none">
      <p class="text-xl font-light leading-relaxed mb-16 reveal">
        The culinary world is intensely competitive. Beyond building brands, my core mission is to elevate the next generation of chefs. Whether you need a resume review or long-term career guidance, I am here to help you navigate the industry.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-16 reveal">
        <div class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-obsidian-black border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-grey/20 p-8 hover:border-saffron-gold/50 transition-colors">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading text-saffron-gold mb-4">Resume & Portfolio Review</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey">
            Your resume is your first impression. Send it over, and I'll help you structure it to highlight your strengths, filter out the noise, and catch the eye of Executive Chefs.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-obsidian-black border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-grey/20 p-8 hover:border-saffron-gold/50 transition-colors">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading text-saffron-gold mb-4">Career Roadmap</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey">
            Stuck as a Commis or Demi Chef? We will sit down and architect a clear, actionable roadmap to accelerate your path to Sous Chef and beyond.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-saffron-gold/10 to-transparent border-l-4 border-saffron-gold p-8 reveal">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading text-obsidian-black dark:text-pristine-white mb-4 mt-0">Ready to accelerate your career?</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey mb-8">
          Send me your resume and a brief introduction on WhatsApp. Let's get to work.
        </p>
        <ContactButton intent="aspiring-chef" text="Connect with Chef Gurbaj" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
